# "SLIDE" — Trap / 808
bpm 140
swing 10
steps 32
reverb 0.15
delay 0.1

kick  "x.....x.....x.x.x.....x.....x.x."
snare "....x.......x.......x.......x..."
hh    "xoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxxoxx"
oh    "..............x...............x."
clap  "....x.......x.......x.......x..."

vol kick 0.9
vol snare 0.75
vol hh 0.45
vol clap 0.65
vol oh 0.4
pan hh 0.15
lpf hh 7000
sidechain kick hh

note "C1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ Eb1 ~ ~ ~ G1 ~ ~ ~ C1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ Eb1 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"
